Package: @PACKAGE_ID@
Name: Python @PY_MAJOR_MINOR@ (k1tty-xz)
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Maintainer: k1tty-xz
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: firmware (>= @MIN_IOS@)
Conflicts: python3, org.coolstar.python3, com.bingner.python3
Replaces: python3, org.coolstar.python3, com.bingner.python3
Description: The Python @PY_MAJOR_MINOR@ interpreter for iOS.
 This package provides a full Python @PY_MAJOR_MINOR@ environment, including:
 .
  * The Python @PY_MAJOR_MINOR@ interpreter (python3, python@PY_MAJOR_MINOR@)
  * Standard library with SSL support (OpenSSL @OPENSSL_VER@)
  * ctypes FFI for loading dynamic libraries
  * decimal arithmetic through libmpdec @MPDECIMAL_VER@
 .
 Note: pip is NOT installed by default. To install it, run:
   python3 -m ensurepip
Icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/k1tty-xz/python-ios-arm64/refs/heads/main/icons/icon.png
